    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17928" root="زكم" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُكْمَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُكَامٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also (tropical:)  The <i>last of the
children</i> of his two parents. (S, K, TA.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ زُكْمَةُ أَبَوَيْهِ</span> <i>He is the last of the children
of his two parents.</i> (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَكْمَةٌ</span>,
in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also (tropical:)  <i>Heavy, and coarse,
rough,</i> or <i>rude.</i> (K, TA.)

